=== meta ===
rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: a literal-name `delattr` on the class takes the method out of the run
origin: #424 R4, ruling 424 Q4 (b) - literal-name setattr/delattr counts; v0.8.0 reported nothing
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


class TestTotal:
    def test_total(self):
        assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


class TestTotal:
    def test_total(self):
        assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75


delattr(TestTotal, "test_total")
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "TEST_DISABLED", "severity": "high", "unit": "TestTotal.test_total"}]
